{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:13 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:13 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:13 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27c3e4ba8be8a5d2b488e1e5acf9f0e4/2026-10/2026-10-29_23_10_46.png\"/><p>高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來大致良好的天氣。</p><p>本港地區今日天晴。日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p>展望明日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:20:45.157023+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:13:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:35:13.528103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:24.883165+00:00","content_hash":"40f8d607ea40ff477e8c9249e45808a76d1fcd7f8ab8fc97a29893b24b692fe7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}